r the  coleslaw is really easy it's basically  mayonnaise mustard vinegar and some  seasoning  [Music]  so for this coleslaw i'm using a cabbage  and carrots if you wanted to add  something else you totally could  [Music]  you're going to add the shredded chicken  to the barbecue sauce give it a stir  it's that easy  [Music]  when you're ready to assemble you'll  place the shredded chicken all over the  cornbread pop it with coleslaw put the  other cornbread on top of it and then  you can slice it into pieces as big or  small as you want  [Music]  [Music]  you can make them really small and make  them like sliders for a party or you can  make them bigger if you're having like a  family barbecue  [Music]  people love this idea that's kind of  novel of having like a sheet pan  sandwich i think the joy of the sandwich  is having this really saucy chicken this  really flavorful coleslaw and then of  course the cornbread and it's all  together and you can just have it in one  bite truly the best combination i put  chicken inside this sandwich but you  could use pulled pork brisket whatever  your favorite barbecue is let us know in  the comments  we're just to shire i'm using ketchup  worchestershire i can never really say  that  [Music]  you
 

